---

This repository builds pre-patched Discord APKs using assets from the
[Valenced project](https://github.com/Valenced/valenced), which is also
licensed under GPL-3.0 (with the android/patches module under AGPL-3.0).

This repository itself does not contain any copyrighted code from Valenced.
It only provides automation scripts and workflows to download and combine
publicly available assets into a pre-patched APK.